<title>GERMANY: Tarkett 96 oper profit down 6.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Tarkett 96 oper profit down 6.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKENTHAL, Germany 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   136     vs 146</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,349   vs 1,340</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German flooring manufacturer is Tarkett AG. The group also said that business improved during the second half of 1996 and that it expected the positive development to continue in 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
